{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_swain": {
        "attack": "【附加包】恶魔手射出乌鸦弹。<#ff9028ff>狂食鸦群<>：帝国视界、永不复行抓到英雄或他打过的英雄阵亡时得到魂屑，回复<#7ee787ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>30%<><#7ee787ff>生命<>，最大生命+15（永久）。<#ff9028ff>帝国视界<>：每<#ffb900ff>16秒<>在远处交战的敌方英雄脚下睁眼，<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>后炸开造成<#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>并<#ef5350ff>减速<>。",
        "ult": "【附加包】化身恶魔，吸取周围敌人的生命：每<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>造成<#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>，每名英雄回复<#7ee787ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>15%<>；吸到英雄时形态延续。<#ffb900ff>2秒<>后放出<#ff9028ff>恶魔耀光<>：<#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>并<#ef5350ff>减速<>。2名敌方英雄在身边或有队友围攻被控者时才放。期间整个化身恶魔。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_swain": {
        "attack": "【擴充包】惡魔之手射出渡鴉彈。<#ff9028ff>群鴉盛宴<>：真知魔眼、影之爪抓到英雄或他打過的英雄陣亡時得到靈魂碎片，回復<#7ee787ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>30%<><#7ee787ff>生命<>，最大生命+15（永久）。<#ff9028ff>真知魔眼<>：每<#ffb900ff>16秒<>在遠處交戰的敵方英雄腳下睜眼，<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>後炸開造成<#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>並<#ef5350ff>緩速<>。",
        "ult": "【擴充包】化身惡魔，汲取周圍敵人的生命：每<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>造成<#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>，每名英雄回復<#7ee787ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>15%<>；汲取到英雄時型態延續。<#ffb900ff>2秒<>後放出<#ff9028ff>魔燄<>：<#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>並<#ef5350ff>緩速<>。2名敵方英雄在身邊或有隊友圍攻被控者時才施放。期間整個化身惡魔。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_swain": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] A raven bolt from his demon hand. <#ff9028ff>Ravenous Flock<>: Soul Fragments from Vision of Empire, Nevermove's pull and the deaths of champions he hurt heal <#7ee787ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>30%<>, +15 max health (for good). <#ff9028ff>Vision of Empire<>: every <#ffb900ff>16s<> an eye opens under a far fighting enemy champion, bursting <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> later for <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>slow<>.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] He becomes the demon and drains nearby enemies: every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, healing <#7ee787ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>15%<> per champion; draining champions keeps the form going. After <#ffb900ff>2s<>, <#ff9028ff>Demonflare<>: <#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>slow<>. Cast with 2 enemy champions close, or an ally on a controlled one. His whole body becomes the demon."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_swain": {
        "attack": "[확장] 악마의 손에서 까마귀 탄 발사. <#ff9028ff>굶주린 새떼<>: 제국의 눈, 속박명령, 그가 공격한 챔피언의 죽음으로 영혼 조각 획득: <#7ee787ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>30%<> 회복, 최대 체력 +15(영구). <#ff9028ff>제국의 눈<>: <#ffb900ff>16초<>마다 싸우는 먼 적 챔피언 발밑에 눈이 열려 <#ffb900ff>1.5초<> 후 폭발, <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>의 <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>와 <#ef5350ff>둔화<>.",
        "ult": "[확장] 악마로 변신해 주변 적의 생명력을 흡수: <#ffb900ff>0.5초<>마다 <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<>의 <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>, 챔피언마다 <#7ee787ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>15%<> 회복; 챔피언을 흡수하면 형태 유지. <#ffb900ff>2초<> 후 <#ff9028ff>악의 불길<>: <#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<>의 <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>와 <#ef5350ff>둔화<>. 적 챔피언 2명이 가까이 있거나 아군이 군중 제어된 적을 칠 때 사용. 온몸이 악마로 변합니다."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_swain": {
        "attack": "【拡張】悪魔の手から魔鴉弾。<#ff9028ff>恐襲の魔鴉<>：帝国の眼、束縛の爪、攻撃したチャンピオンの死で「魂のかけら」を得て<#7ee787ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>30%<>回復、最大体力+15（永続）。<#ff9028ff>帝国の眼<>：<#ffb900ff>16秒<>毎に戦う遠くの敵の足元に眼が開き、<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>後に爆発し<#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>と<#ef5350ff>スロウ<>。",
        "ult": "【拡張】悪魔に変身し周囲の敵から吸収：<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>毎に<#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>、チャンピオン毎に<#7ee787ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>15%<>回復。チャンピオンを吸収する間は持続。<#ffb900ff>2秒<>後「<#ff9028ff>悪魔の紅炎<>」：<#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>と<#ef5350ff>スロウ<>。敵2体が近いか、味方がCC中の敵を攻撃中に使う。その間全身が悪魔になる。"
      }
    }
  }
}
